      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-05-22T14:46:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, I didn't mean Doctor Medico&nbsp;<em>wasn't</em>&nbsp;welcome right now, but I will accept the canon Sentinel Comics universe answer that every character but Doctor Medico is welcome at my house! ;)</p>\n<p>I think the answer about Tachyon running faster than light was surprisingly beautiful - in-universe, she&nbsp;<em>shouldn't</em>&nbsp;be able to do that, and she&nbsp;<em>knows</em> that, and that's one of the questions that dogs her studies. Very cool!</p>",
