    {
      "id": 227569,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-05-23T18:44:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So now we know that every character in Prime War either comes from a destroyed universe, or was lost in time and space (or similar).&nbsp; I get the impression that this is connected to C&amp;A's insistence that the characters who left Universe One via a Mist Portal didn't necessarily make it back home.&nbsp; So it's possible that the Inversiverse is gone (since Black Frost is displaced), but Princess Luminary is still out there somewhere.&nbsp; Same goes for Supply &amp; Demand Benchmark.&nbsp; There's also the Ahoraverse (Night Terror and Disparation Dark Watch), and I don't think we know what universe Windwalker is from.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:48.062Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 2,
      "readers_count": 1,
      "score": 15.4,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 19198,
      "topic_slug": "editor-s-note-30",
      "display_username": "MindWanderer",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
